menu "GSP/LVGL presenter ownership handoff stress test"

    config APP_HANDOFF_CYCLES
        int "GSP <-> LVGL handoff cycles per reporting batch"
        range 1 1000
        default 5
        help
            Each cycle runs a GSP phase, pauses GSP, hands the shared
            presenter to LVGL, then resumes GSP. Batches repeat until
            the device is reset.

    config APP_PHASE_SECONDS
        int "Duration of each GSP/LVGL phase (seconds)"
        range 1 3600
        default 5
        help
            GSP animates for this long before the pause, and LVGL pumps
            lv_timer_handler() for this long before tearing down.

endmenu
